+## 2026-05-19 18:05 +03 - BE-0544
+- What was implemented
+  - Added the backend repository conventions guide at `docs/development/repository-conventions.md`.
+  - Added `internal/release/repository_conventions_static_test.go` to pin the guide, release-gate wiring, expected commands, expected outputs, redaction, stable envelope, isolated Postgres, and fake-Dokploy requirements.
+  - Wired the new static test into `scripts/verify.sh`, `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `SECURITY.md`, and `internal/release/AGENTS.md`.
+  - Marked BE-0544 as passing in `ralph/prd.json`.
+- Files changed
+  - `.github/workflows/ci.yml`
+  - `SECURITY.md`
+  - `docs/development/repository-conventions.md`
