+- Verification run
+  - Red phase: `go test ./internal/release/... -run TestRepositoryConventionsArtifact` failed before the guide and gate wiring existed.
+  - `gofmt -w .`
+  - `goimports -w .` was not run because `goimports` is not installed.
+  - `go mod tidy`
+  - `go test ./...`
+  - `go test -race ./...`
+  - `go vet ./...`
